==Battleground==
*3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Loris]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 50~56.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,700f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
**2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn, delay 36~40 seconds<sup>1,080f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A standard early strategy of using [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] to build up your worker cat to max level before attacking the base works well here. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]] is helpful in this stage, as are the standard anti-Zombie package of [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong]], [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight]] and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]]. Holyblast cannon works well for chip damage and freeze.

==Trivia==
*The name of this stage is a pun on second life and a possible reference to a [[wikipedia:Second Life|videogame]] with that name.

